                                        "value": "<div><font size=\"+1\"><b>Mix Factor</font></b><br><font color='#949495'>Mixing factor for blending input and output values. A value of 0\nuses only the input, 1 uses only the output, and intermediate\nvalues perform a linear interpolation.</div>"
