                                        "type": "std::string",
                                        "value": "<div><font size=\"+1\"><b>Smoothing Radius</font></b><br><font color='#949495'>Defines the radius for post-processing smoothing, determining\nthe size of the neighborhood used to average local values and\nreduce high-frequency detail. A radius of 0 disables smoothing.</div>"
